  "description": "Wedding Bundle Font Collection\nCreate timeless and romantic designs with The Wedding Font Collection. This carefully curated bundle features 22 elegant typefaces inspired by luxury wedding aesthetics, sophisticated stationery, and graceful editorial typography.\nFrom refined serif styles to flowing scripts, each font is designed to bring a sense of beauty, intimacy, and sophistication into your creative projects. The collection combines delicate details, graceful curves, and modern elegance, perfect for creating memorable visual experiences. Whether you are designing for weddings, luxury brands, or feminine editorials, this bundle provides versatile typography that feels both classic and contemporary.",
